WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:05.637
Open Calendar to see household appointments. Use the date and people controls to

00:05.637 --> 00:11.070
focus the view. If an appointment seems missing, check the selected date and person

00:11.070 --> 00:11.593
filters.

00:15.400 --> 00:20.772
Use the add action to create an appointment. Enter its title, date and time, then

00:20.772 --> 00:26.011
choose who it belongs to. Review repeat or reminder options when you need them.

00:30.400 --> 00:35.588
After saving, review the appointment in Calendar. Today shows the schedule for the

00:35.588 --> 00:40.839
current day. Open the original appointment if you need to edit its details or check

00:40.839 --> 00:41.408
the time.

00:45.400 --> 00:50.558
Apple Calendar integration is optional. Use the appointment option when you want a

00:50.558 --> 00:55.905
copy there and review the destination calendar. Permission is needed; using the local

00:55.905 --> 00:58.358
household calendar does not require it.
